\"fableDescription\":\"Claude Fable 5.1 will include an invisible text watermark. Choose how to continue.\",\"recommended\":\"Recommended\",\"astraPrivacyBenefit\":\"Zero data retention (more private)\",\"astraBenchmarkBenefit\":\"Leads Fable on many published benchmarks\",\"switchAstra\":\"Switch to Astra\",\"fableRetention\":\"Uses 30-day data retention and Anthropic’s invisible watermark.\",\"continueFable\":\"Continue with Fable\",\"privacyHeading\":\"Privacy\",\"fablePrivacyDetails\":\"In AI Drive, Astra uses zero data retention: prompts and responses are not retained by the provider after processing. Fable uses 30-day retention by default.\",\"benchmarksHeading\":\"Benchmarks\",\"fableBenchmarkDetails\":\"Astra leads Fable on many published coding, science, and professional-work benchmarks. Results vary by task and reasoning level.\",\"fableRetentionLink\":\"Anthropic’s Fable retention policy\",\"astraBenchmarksLink\":\"OpenAI’s Astra benchmark table\",\"independentAstraLink\":\"Independent Astra results\",\"independentFableLink\":\"Independent Fable results\",\"fableModel\":\"Claude Fable 5.1\",\"label\":\"Claude model update\",\"title\":\"Anthropic is adding watermarks to Claude text\",\"description\":\"Anthropic says new Claude models will include an invisible text watermark, with older models to follow. It is designed to help identify text generated by Claude.\",\"choose\":\"Choose how to continue\",\"alternative\":\"Try a different model without Claude’s watermark.\",\"tryModel\":\"Try {model}\",\"claude\":\"Keep using Claude as Anthropic rolls out text watermarking.\",\"continue\":\"Continue with Claude\",\"learnMore\":\"Learn more\",\"pattern\":\"The watermark is a pattern in word choices, not hidden characters or a visible label.\",\"privacy\":\"It carries no information identifying you, your organization, or your conversation.\",\"quality\":\"Anthropic says it does not affect text quality, adds no tokens or cost, and has negligible impact on speed.\",\"announcement\":\"Read Anthropic’s announcement\"},\"mentionList\":{\"sharedWithYou\":\"Shared with you\",\"loadingSharedFiles\":\"Loading shared files…\",\"noResults\":\"No results\"},\"navbar\":{\"blogEngineering\":\"Engineering \u0026 Research\",\"blogProduct\":\"Product \u0026 Customer Stories\",\"navigation\":\"AI Drive\",\"getPro\":\"Get AI Drive Pro now\",\"faq\":\"FAQ\",\"resources\":\"Resources\",\"contactUs\":\"Contact Us\",\"blog\":\"Blog\",\"signUp\":\"Sign up\",\"logIn\":\"Log In\",\"security\":\"Security\",\"appearance\":\"Appearance\"},\"common\":{\"search\":\"Search\",\"chat\":\"Chat\",\"close\":\"Close\",\"folderCreationError\":\"Error while creating folder\",\"upgradeToChat\":\"Upgrade to Chat\",\"upgradeToOcr\":\"Upgrade to OCR\",\"ocrSuccess\":\"File OCR completed\",\"ocrProgress\":\"File OCR in progress\",\"ocrTimedOut\":\"OCR process timed out, please contact help@myaidrive.com to resolve\",\"ocrFailed\":\"File OCR failed, email help@myaidrive.com\",\"ocrNormmalUser\":\"Pro users get automatic file OCR, folder links to search multiple files and more.Click to upgrade.\",\"fetchingChatHistory\":\"Fetching chat history...\",\"fetchingCustomAgent\":\"Fetching Custom Agent data...\",\"loadingContent\":\"Loading content...\",\"loadingWorkspace\":\"Loading your workspace\",\"preparingFile\":\"Please wait while we prepare your file\",\"agentOverlay\":{\"featuredAgents\":\"Featured Agents\",\"featuredByAiDrive\":\"Featured by AI Drive\",\"yourAgents\":\"My Agents\",\"createCustom\":\"Custom Agent Builder\",\"createCustomDesc\":\"Build specialized AI agents for recurring tasks, specific clients or custom workflows.\",\"noAgentsFound\":\"No agents found.\",\"retry\":\"Retry\",\"aiAssistant\":\"AI Assistant\",\"welcomeTo\":\"Welcome to\",\"subtitle\":\"Choose a featured agent or start a conversation\",\"newCustomAgent\":\"New Custom Agent\",\"createWithAi\":\"Create with AI\",\"configureManually\":\"Configure manually\",\"chatWithAgent\":\"Chat with {name}\",\"editAgent\":\"Edit {name}\",\"builderInfo\":\"About AI-assisted agent creation\",\"builderInfoDescription\":\"Describe the outcome or recurring task you want handled. AI Drive will propose a name, icon, model, description, knowledge sources and detailed instructions. You can review and customize everything before the agent is created.\",\"guidedCreationPrompt\":\"Help me create a custom agent. Start by asking what I want to accomplish or which recurring task I want handled. Once you understand the goal, ask which model I want and recommend GPT-6 Sol if I do not choose one. Then propose sensible defaults for everything else and let me customize only what matters before I review the approval card.\",\"categories\":{\"all\":\"All\",\"featured\":\"Featured\",\"research\":\"Research\",\"legal\":\"Legal\",\"productivity\":\"Productivity\",\"finance\":\"Finance\",\"marketing\":\"Marketing\",\"engineering\":\"Engineering\"},\"seeMore\":\"See more\",\"seeAll\":\"See all\",\"recentlyUsed\":\"Recently Used\",\"chooseAgentSubtitle\":\"Choose a custom agent or start a conversation by typing a message\",\"shared\":\"Shared\",\"favorites\":\"Favorites\"},\"fileDropZone\":{\"title\":\"Drop files to chat\",\"subtitle\":\"Add files to your conversation\",\"nonPdfIgnored\":\"Non-PDF files will be ignored.\",\"proUserRequired\":\"You need to be a Pro user to chat with non-PDF files.\"},\"proceed\":\"Proceed\",\"sort\":{\"title\":\"Sort folder contents\",\"nameAsc\":\"Name (A to Z)\",\"nameDesc\":\"Name (Z to A)\",\"dateAsc\":\"Created (Oldest first)\",\"dateDesc\":\"Created (Newest first)\",\"modifiedAsc\":\"Modified (Oldest first)\",\"modifiedDesc\":\"Modified (Newest first)\"},\"links\":{\"website\":\"website\",\"products\":\"Products\",\"faqs\":\"FAQs\",\"contactUs\":\"Contact Us\",\"blog\":\"Blog\",\"pricing\":\"Pricing\",\"resources\":\"Resources\",\"company\":\"Company\",\"contact\":\"Contact\",\"legal\":\"Legal\",\"privacyPolicy\":\"Privacy Policy\",\"terms\":\"Terms of Se