s, due diligence, and regulatory document review\",\"examples\":[\"Contract summarization\",\"Legal research\",\"Compliance audits\"]},\"financial\":{\"title\":\"Financial Services\",\"description\":\"Financial reports, investment analysis, and risk assessment\",\"examples\":[\"Earnings analysis\",\"Risk reports\",\"Investment memos\"]},\"healthcare\":{\"title\":\"Healthcare\",\"description\":\"Medical records, research papers, and clinical documentation\",\"examples\":[\"Patient records\",\"Research analysis\",\"Clinical trials\"]},\"realEstate\":{\"title\":\"Real Estate\",\"description\":\"Property documents, market analysis, and investment reports\",\"examples\":[\"Property analysis\",\"Market reports\",\"Investment docs\"]},\"education\":{\"title\":\"Education \u0026 Research\",\"description\":\"Academic papers, research documents, and educational content\",\"examples\":[\"Research papers\",\"Study materials\",\"Academic reports\"]},\"business\":{\"title\":\"Business Operations\",\"description\":\"Reports, proposals, manuals, and operational documents\",\"examples\":[\"Business plans\",\"SOPs\",\"Training materials\"]}}},\"supportTutorials\":{\"title\":\"Tutorials \u0026 Guides\",\"youtubeDescription\":\"View all guides and instructional content on our YouTube channel.\",\"youtubeButton\":\"Visit YouTube Channel\",\"tutorials\":{\"aiDrivePro\":\"Meet AI Drive PRO - The AI That Powers Your Documents\",\"aiModels\":\"Overwhelmed by the constant wave of new AI models?\",\"ultimateGuide\":\"The Ultimate Guide to AI PDF and AI Drive\"}},\"faq\":{\"badge\":\"SUPPORT\",\"title\":\"Your Questions, Answered\"},\"testimonials\":{\"title\":\"What professionals say\",\"subtitle\":\"See how organizations across industries are transforming their document workflows with AI Drive.\",\"testimonials\":{\"tyler\":{\"quote\":\"I started realizing I can access this information faster than any human can because it searches instantly\",\"author\":\"Tyler Breaux\",\"role\":\"Lawyer\"},\"steve\":{\"quote\":\"This is a game changer! What was taking me four days, now, takes me under a minute.\",\"author\":\"Steve Harvey\",\"role\":\"City of Mulberry, Arkansas\"},\"christian\":{\"quote\":\"The accuracy and attention to detail are impressive, and it really makes my work more efficient.\",\"author\":\"Christian\"}}},\"cta\":{\"title\":\"Supercharge your team's productivity\",\"subtitle\":\"Unlock AI-powered collaboration for your entire team. Scale smarter, work faster, and achieve more together with advanced document intelligence and seamless team workflows.\",\"buttons\":{\"primary\":\"Book Business Demo\",\"secondary\":\"Schedule Business Demo\"},\"features\":\"Includes onboarding call with AI Drive founder • No setup fees • Cancel anytime\",\"benefits\":[\"Team Collaboration\",\"300,000 Credits/month\",\"Priority Support\",\"Unlimited Upload\"]}},\"checkout\":{\"paymentCancelled\":\"Payment cancelled\"},\"securityPageClient\":{\"hero\":{\"title\":\"Safe. Secure. Private.\",\"subtitle\":\"Everything in AI Drive is designed to keep your documents safe and secure. Because your business is nobody else's business.\",\"soc2Badge\":\"SOC 2 Type 2\",\"iso27001Badge\":\"ISO 27001\",\"visitTrustCenter\":\"Visit Trust Center\",\"requestSecurityDocs\":\"Request Security Docs\"},\"enterpriseSecurity\":{\"title\":\"Enterprise-grade security\",\"subtitle\":\"We've invested heavily in building a security infrastructure that meets the needs of the world's most security-conscious organizations.\",\"soc2\":{\"title\":\"SOC 2 Type 1 \u0026 Type 2\",\"status\":\"Examinations completed\",\"description\":\"Independent SOC 2 Type 1 and Type 2 examinations covering controls relevant to Security, Availability, and Confidentiality\",\"requestLink\":\"Request SOC 2 reports →\"},\"iso27001\":{\"title\":\"ISO 27001\",\"status\":\"Compliant\",\"description\":\"International standard for information security management systems (ISMS).\",\"requestLink\":\"Request ISO 27001 Certificate →\"},\"auditLogs\":{\"title\":\"Audit Logs\",\"status\":\"Enterprise\",\"description\":\"Detailed activity logs for compliance monitoring and security auditing.\",\"learnMore\":\"Learn more →\"},\"adminControls\":{\"title\":\"Admin Controls\",\"status\":\"Enterprise\",\"description\":\"Granular permissions, SSO integration, and organization management.\",\"learnMore\":\"Learn more →\"}},\"identityManagement\":{\"title\":\"Identity management\",\"subtitle\":\"Control who has access to your workspace with enterprise-grade identity and access management features.\",\"sso\":{\"title\":\"Single Sign-On\",\"description\":\"SAML-based SSO with major identity providers.\"},\"rbac\":{\"title\":\"Role-based Access\",\"description\":\"Granular permissions for team members.\"}},\"privacy\":{\"title\":\"Privacy\",\"subtitle\":\"Your data belongs to you. We've built AI Drive with privacy-first principles to ensure you maintain full control over your information.\",\"dataEncryption\":{\"title\":\"Data Encryption\",\"description\":\"AES-256 encryption at rest, TLS 1.3 in transit. Your data is always protected.\"},\"noAiTraining\":{\"title\":\"No AI Training\",\"description\":\"AI Drive does not train models on your data, and we have agreements with our AI providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, and xAI/Grok) that ensure your data is never used for their model training.\"},\"zeroDataRetention\":{\"title\":\"Zero Data Retention\",\"enterpriseBadge\":\"Enterprise\",\"description\":\"Enterprise customers can enable zero data retention with OpenAI, Anthropic, Google (Gemini), and xAI (Grok).\"},\"usDataCenters\":{\"title\":\"US Hosting \u0026 Storage\",\"description\":\"Customer files, chat history, platform hosting, and core infrastructure are stored and operated in Google Cloud US data centers.\"},\"aiSubprocessors\":{\"title\":\"AI Subprocessors\",\"subtitle\":\"We integrate with leading AI providers under enterprise agreements that ensure your data privacy.\",\"openai\":\"OpenAI\",\"anthropic\":\"Anthropic\",\"google\":\"Google (Gemini)\",\"xai\":\"xAI (Grok)\",\"unitedStates\":\"United States\",\"aiProcessing\":\"AI Processing\",\"viewAll\":\"View all subprocessors across all categories →\",\"notifications\":{\"title\":\"Get subprocessor change notifications\",\"description\":\"Receive an email when a subprocessor is added or removed.\",\"signInCopy\":\"Sign in to subscribe to subprocessor change notifications.\",\"signIn\":\"Sign in\",\"paidOnly\":\"Subprocessor notifications are available to Pro, Business, and Enterprise customers.\",\"managePlan\":\"Upgrade plan\",\"loading\":\"Loading your notification settings…\",\"loadError\":\"We couldn't load your notification settings.\",\"retry\":\"Try again\",\"emailLabel\":\"Email address\",\"emailPlaceholder\":\"you@example.com\",\"invalidEmail\":\"Enter a valid email address.\",\"subscribe\":\"Subscribe\",\"subscribing\":\"Subscribing…\",\"subscribeSuccess\":\"You're subscribed to subprocessor change notifications.\",\"subscribedAs\":\"Notifications will be sent to {email}.\",\"unsubscribe\":\"Unsubscribe\",\"unsubscribing\":\"Unsubscribing…\",\"unsubscribeSuccess\":\"You've unsubscribed from subprocessor change notifications.\",\"actionError\":\"We couldn't update your notification settings. Please try again.\"}}},\"controls\":{\"title\":\"Continuously Monitored Controls\",\"subtitle\":\"Our security controls are continuously monitored and audited to ensure the highest level of protection.\",\"productSecurityCount\":\"4\",\"productSecurity\":\"Product Security\",\"dataSecurityCount\":\"10\",\"dataSecurity\":\"Data Security\",\"networkSecurityCount\":\"8\",\"networkSecurity\":\"Network Security\",\"appSecurityCount\":\"3\",\"appSecurity\":\"App Security\",\"endpointSecurityCount\":\"5\",\"endpointSecurity\":\"Endpoint Security\",\"corporateSecurityCount\":\"27\",\"corporateSecurity\":\"Corporate Security\",\"viewAllControls\":\"View all controls in Trust Center\"},\"leadership\":{\"title\":\"Security in Our DNA\",\"subtitle\":\"Our founders bring decades of security expertise from leading technology companies.\",\"karthik\":{\"name\":\"Karthik\",\"role\":\"Co-founder\",\"description\":\"Former Google Cloud AI Engineer\"},\"vicente\":{\"name\":\"Vicente\",\"role\":\"Co-founder\",\"description\":\"Former Principal Product Manager at WhatsApp/Meta\"}},\"faq\":{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"items\":{\"encryption\":{\"question\":\"How is my data encrypted?\",\"answer\":\"All data is encrypted using AES-256 encryption at rest and TLS 1.3 in transit. We use Google Cloud Platform's key management service for secure key storage and rotation.\"},\"soc2\":{\"question\":\"Has AI Drive completed a SOC 2 Type 2 examination?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. V2K AI, Inc. completed a SOC 2 Type 2 examination covering controls relevant to Security, Availability, and Confidentiality. Eligible customers and business partners can request the report by emailing security@v2k.ai.\"},\"aiTraining\":{\"question\":\"Do you use my data to train AI models?\",\"answer\":\"No. AI Drive does not train models on your data, and we have agreements with our AI providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, and xAI/Grok) that ensure your data is never used for their model training. Enterprise customers can also enable zero data retention with OpenAI, Anthropic, Google (Gemini), and xAI (Grok).\"},\"dataStorage\":{\"question\":\"Where is my data stored?\",\"answer\":\"Customer files, chat history, platform hosting, and core infrastructure are stored and operated in Google Cloud Platform data centers located in the United States. These facilities are SOC 2 certified and follow industry-leading physical and environmental security practices.\"},\"aiProcessingRegions\":{\"question\":\"Can AI model requests be processed outside the U.S.?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. AI model execution may use global provider endpoints by default. Enterprise customers can opt in to U.S.-only AI model execution for supported models and providers. In all cases, AI Drive does not use your data for model training. Customer files, chat history, platform hosting, and core infrastructure remain stored and operated in the United States.\"}}},\"cta\":{\"title\":\"Ready to get started?\",\"titleLoggedIn\":\"Back to AI Drive\",\"subtitle\":\"Join thousands of teams who trust AI Drive with their documents.\",\"startFreeTrial\":\"Start Free\",\"openAiDrive\":\"Open AI Drive\",\"contactUs\":\"Contact Us\"}},\"sftlaTahoePage\":{\"title\":\"SFTLA Tahoe 2026\",\"subtitle\":\"Interested in how AI can transform your practice? Leave your info and we'll follow up with you.\",\"error\":{\"formLoadFailed\":\"Unable to load the form. Please try refreshing the page.\",\"reachUs\":\"You can also reach us at\"}},\"strunzEventPage\":{\"heroTitle\":\"High Performance AI for All Your\",\"heroTitleHighlight\":\"Office Documentation\",\"heroDescription\":\"Powered by the world's best AI models: Transform contracts, petitions, and legal opinions into intelligent conversations.\",\"ctaText\":\"Fill in your details and win a Stanley Cup*\",\"ctaDisclaimer\":\"*The prize will be shipped within two weeks after the event\",\"privacyNotice\":\"By submitting this form, \u003cconsent\u003eyou agree to the use of the provided data\u003c/consent\u003e for enrollment in content flows, rich materials (E-books, Whitepapers, etc.), event invitations, and commercial contact. You can opt out of these communications at any time. This data collection is carried out in accordance with applicable data protection laws. For more information about our practices, see our \u003cpolicy\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/policy\u003e.\",\"error\":{\"formLoadFailed\":\"Unable to load the form. Please try refreshing the page.\",\"reachUs\":\"You can also reach us at\"}},\"marketing\":{\"footer\":{\"tagline\":\"Enterprise-grade AI document processing platform trusted by hundreds of thousands of professionals worldwide.\"},\"devLanding\":{\"title\":\"Marketing Pages\",\"subtitle\":\"Standalone development server for AI Drive marketing pages.\"}},\"imanageDownloads\":{\"title\":\"Import documents from iManage\",\"description\":\"Optional setup for {name}. Import original files into AI Drive using your iManage account. MCP works independently.\",\"error\":\"Unable to complete this action. Close and reopen these settings, then try again.\",\"loading\":\"Loading…\",\"NOT_CONFIGURED\":\"Downloads are not configured.\",\"AUTH_REQUIRED\":\"Sign in to authorize downloads.\",\"ACTIVE\":\"Downloads are authorized.\",\"authError\":\"Authorization needs attention. Sign in again.\",\"host\":\"Host\",\"secretHint\":\"A secret is saved. Leave blank to keep it; enter a new secret when changing the host, tenant, or client.\",\"policy\":\"Agent import permission\",\"ask\":\"Ask before importing\",\"auto\":\"Allow imports\",\"deny\":\"Block imports\",\"save\":\"Save settings\",\"saved\":\"Settings saved.\",\"callback\":\"Callback URL\",\"callbackHint\":\"Register this exact callback URL in your iManage application.\",\"setupRequired\":\"An administrator must configure the download authorization callback before you can sign in.\",\"authorize\":\"Authorize downloads\",\"remove\":\"Remove download setup\",\"saveFirst\":\"Save your changes before authorizing downloads.\"},\"customMcpSlackApp\":{\"loadingCompanies\":\"Loading companies…\",\"appIdHint\":\"Starts with A; use 2–64 uppercase letters or digits.\",\"workspaceIdHint\":\"Starts with T; use 2–64 uppercase letters or digits.\",\"clientIdHint\":\"Use the numeric Slack client ID, such as 123456.789012 (1–64 digits on each side of the dot).\",\"upstreamRevoke\":\"Removing a connection or company app configuration disables access in AI Drive. To revoke access in Slack too, a Slack workspace admin must uninstall or revoke the app in Slack.\",\"otherScopeHint\":\"Additional scopes returned by the service: review the official Slack guide before adding them.\",\"optionalScopeHint\":\"Optional: add these scopes only if you will enable this capability.\",\"publicScopeHint\":\"Use these scopes for public-channel reading, the default capability.\",\"company\":\"Company\",\"chooseCompany\":\"Choose a company to manage Slack and MCP settings\",\"title\":\"Company Slack app\",\"intro\":\"An Enterprise admin configures the company’s internal Slack app. Saving this setup does not enable MCP or grant member access.\",\"configured\":\"Company app configured\",\"notConfigured\":\"Company app not configured\",\"instructions\":\"Setup instructions\",\"createStep\":\"Create an internal Slack app in your company’s workspace at api.slack.com/apps. A Slack workspace admin may need to approve it.\",\"scopesStep\":\"In OAuth \u0026 Permissions, add User Token Scopes only for the capabilities you intend to allow below. App scopes make capabilities possible; each member’s grant remains limited by the admin’s selections and Slack access. Do not configure a bot, Event Subscriptions, or Socket Mode for this connection.\",\"callbackStep\":\"Under Redirect URLs, add and save this exact callback URL:\",\"credentialsStep\":\"In Basic Information → App Credentials, copy the App ID, Client ID, and Client Secret. Find the Workspace ID in your workspace’s Slack URL. Enter them below; the secret is stored privately.\",\"enableStep\":\"After saving the app, enable custom MCP, add Slack to the allowed servers, and explicitly save its audience and capabilities.\",\"memberStep\":\"Each authorized member connects with their own Slack account, tests the connection to enable tools, then selects it in an agent. Scheduled and email-triggered agents can read authorized data; sends require interactive approval.\",\"docs\":\"Official Slack MCP setup guide\",\"setup\":\"Set up Slack app\",\"edit\":\"Edit app or rotate secret\",\"remove\":\"Remove app\",\"confirmRemove\":\"Remove company app\",\"reconnectWarning\":\"Replacing credentials or removing the app invalidates existing connections. Members must reconnect and test again.\",\"secretHint\":\"The secret is write-only and is never displayed. Keep the existing secret by leaving rotation off; changing app identifiers requires a new secret.\",\"appId\":\"App ID\",\"workspaceId\":\"Workspace ID\",\"clientId\":\"Client ID\",\"secret\":\"Client Secret\",\"rotate\":\"Replace the stored secret\",\"cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"save\":\"Save app\",\"reload\":\"Reload\",\"copy\":\"Copy callback URL\",\"copied\":\"Copied\",\"copyError\":\"Could not copy. Select and copy the callback URL manually.\",\"loadError\":\"Could not load Slack app settings. Reload to try again.\",\"saveError\":\"Could not save Slack app settings. Check the values and enter the secret again if needed.\",\"conflict\":\"Another admin changed these settings. They have been reloaded; reopen the form and review before saving.\",\"forbidden\":\"Your admin access changed. Reload the settings.\",\"infrastructureUnavailable\":\"Slack setup is unavailable until the service configuration is ready.\"}},\"now\":\"$undefined\",\"timeZone\":\"UTC\",\"children\":\"$L2c\"}]\n2d:I[268241,[\"/_next/static/chunks/30zymypg-5hjt.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2vzr1w-dqgjrc.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1tngcd3ivns20.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3xs7dqir2-d6m.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1zhxo2f6m4eay.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3uo4p3cib3u8t.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2dtw1fmfjnwpy.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0noi9m_o50fzl.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2n9i2gun9wh3g.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2ejgnr9563d3m.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2ws10-z-1j6s-.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0tcq6caftmchm.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2ha3indvj1nf1.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0ps93hv2ssh6e.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0dixwi7tmq3mr.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/39iw98b00jxks.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/23jefyf2l4qrh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0m54l9o6tnudz.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0eiyb-v49u9_m.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/42ia4feblkcww.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2b08f_qsfb6c3.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks